              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/counit+of+an+adjunction"} counits
              is an “elementary” definition (so that by implication, the formulation in terms of hom-isomorphismsunctor#InTermsOfHomIsomorphism) is not elementary) in the sense that while the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/hom-functor"} hom-functor
              formulation relies on some notion of
