              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/language"} language
              of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/categories"} categories
              and makes no reference to a model of
              = succeed "." do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/set+theory"} set theory
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/locally+small"} local smallness
              is not made.
